    <node id="&quot;FOURIER TRANSFORMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fourier transforms are mathematical techniques discussed in the study group at ASU, related to Vasan Venugopalan's academic interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transforms are mathematical tools used in signal processing and analysis, mentioned as a topic of interest for the friends."</data>
